    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「ごめん。何かあたしが怖がられてるっぽい、どうしてかしらね……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「まぁ三年生だし、あたしがヤンチャしてた時期に何かしたんだっけ？　覚えてないけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「あたしが喋りかけても、『ごめんなさい、お金なら払います！』って財布を取りだすだけで会話になんないのよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「あんた、桐島さん、ちょっと相手してやってくれる？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
