    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「まぁ本気で、べつに悪さするつもりないから警戒しないでね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「演劇部だって大忙しなんだから、合唱部の事情にまで首突っこんでたら身がもたねぇのよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「でもま。長居さんのお陰で、ちょっと血が騒いじゃったっていうかね……若返った気分だわ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「教師どもの押しつけがましい『やりくち』なんて、吹き飛ばしてやりましょうよ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「文化系の部活動の連名で、『文化部部長会議』で決定した諸々に異議申し立てがあったからね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「これから文化祭までの短い期間のなかで、実績をだせれば廃部は免れる」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「……かもしれない、って感じだけどね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「何もせずに漫然と過ごしてすべて失うよりは、ちょっとは足掻いたほうがいいでしょ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「廃部になったとしても、人生はつづく。負け犬根性を染みつかせちゃあ、お先真っ暗よ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「あたしが言うんだから、まちがいないわ。自分で言ってて、耳が痛いけどね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
