  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「かいりは、ううん他のみんなも……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「ほとんど諦めてましたの、でも湖南先輩のお陰で息を吹き返しましたのよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「合唱部、絶対に存続させたいですの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「かいりはね、『他にやりたいこともないから』みたいなフワッとした理由でここにいますの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「でもね、だからといって……。むざむざ大事なものを奪い去られるのを、黙って見てられませんのよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「かいり、のろまだから、いつも失ってから気づくんですけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「今回はそういうわけにはいきませんの、腕まくりして抵抗しちゃいますの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「かいり、強く言われると怖くて従っちゃう……。流されて、言いなりになっちゃう。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「臆病者ですの、自分が情けないです。でも、そんな自分とは『おさらば』しますの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「かいりも、マルちゃんみたいに……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「どうしようもない現状に抗って、手を尽くして、走り回って、大事なものを守りたい」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「育てたい、かいりの『からっぽ』だった胸のなかに大輪の花を咲かせますの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「そして、マルちゃんに『どうだ！』って自慢してやりますのよ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「うん、いい度胸。気に入ったわ、あんた。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「その『ですの』とかいうお嬢さま口調は、どうも誰かさんを思いだしちゃってむやみに苛々するけど～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「まぁいいわ。駄弁ってる余裕はねぇのよ、やることやっちゃいましょ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「廃部を免れるかもしれない条件は、文化祭までの短い期間のなかで実績をつくること。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「合唱部だと、合唱コンクールみたいなのに出場して入賞すればいいのかしら？」"
